        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek BTB-86184, 8 Inch Baden Back-To-Back Door Handle Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 8 Inch Baden Pull Set comes packaged with 2 pulls and the hardware to mount them back-to-back on a single door. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2-1/4 inch thick doors. This modern door pull is available in several contemporary finishes. The 8 Inch Baden Back-To-Back Door Handle Pair is a great choice for contemporary spaces. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Packaged with 2 door pulls (1 door pull for each side of a door).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/baden-8-inch-pull-emtek-86184\"><b>Baden Pull with Thru-Bolt Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Baden Solid Brass Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1\" x 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern7-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354499\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
